{"audio": "1peter-05.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 107067, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "1 Peter, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 20133, "text": "The elders which are among you I exhort, who am also an elder, and a witness of the sufferings of Christ, and also a partaker of the glory that shall be revealed: Feed the flock of God which is among you, taking the oversight thereof, not by constraint, but willingly; not for filthy lucre,"}, {"start_ms": 20133, "end_ms": 27867, "text": "but of a ready mind; Neither as being lords over God's heritage, but being ensamples to the flock."}, {"start_ms": 27867, "end_ms": 32933, "text": "And when the chief Shepherd shall appear, ye shall receive a crown of glory that fadeth not away."}, {"start_ms": 32933, "end_ms": 36533, "text": "Likewise, ye younger, submit yourselves unto the elder."}, {"start_ms": 36533, "end_ms": 44933, "text": "Yea, all of you be subject one to another, and be clothed with humility: for God resisteth the proud, and giveth grace to the humble."}, {"start_ms": 44933, "end_ms": 53867, "text": "Humble yourselves therefore under the mighty hand of God, that he may exalt you in due time: Casting all your care upon him; for he careth for you."}, {"start_ms": 53867, "end_ms": 68267, "text": "Be sober, be vigilant; because your adversary the devil, as a roaring lion, walketh about, seeking whom he may devour: Whom resist stedfast in the faith, knowing that the same afflictions are accomplished in your brethren that are in the world."}, {"start_ms": 68267, "end_ms": 79333, "text": "But the God of all grace, who hath called us unto his eternal glory by Christ Jesus, after that ye have suffered a while, make you perfect, stablish, strengthen, settle you."}, {"start_ms": 79333, "end_ms": 82533, "text": "To him be glory and dominion for ever and ever."}, {"start_ms": 82533, "end_ms": 83200, "text": "Amen."}, {"start_ms": 83200, "end_ms": 93467, "text": "By Silvanus, a faithful brother unto you, as I suppose, I have written briefly, exhorting, and testifying that this is the true grace of God wherein ye stand."}, {"start_ms": 93467, "end_ms": 100400, "text": "The church that is at Babylon, elected together with you, saluteth you; and so doth Marcus my son."}, {"start_ms": 100400, "end_ms": 103200, "text": "Greet ye one another with a kiss of charity."}, {"start_ms": 103200, "end_ms": 105867, "text": "Peace be with you all that are in Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 105867, "end_ms": 107067, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 1129, "si": 0}, {"t": "Peter,", "s": 1129, "e": 1392, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1513, "e": 1835, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s": 1896, "e": 2279, "si": 0}, {"t": "The", "s": 2940, "e": 3020, "si": 1}, {"t": "elders", "s": 3101, "e": 3401, "si": 1}, {"t": "which", "s": 3401, "e": 3561, "si": 1}, {"t": "are", "s": 3601, "e": 3701, "si": 1}, {"t": "among", "s": 3741, "e": 4001, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 4041, "e": 4141, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 4301, "e": 4321, "si": 1}, {"t": "exhort,", "s": 4361, "e": 4802, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 5002, "e": 5082, "si": 1}, {"t": "am", "s": 5142, "e": 5222, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 5282, "e": 5522, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 5602, "e": 5682, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder,", "s": 5742, "e": 6023, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6283, "e": 6383, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 6423, "e": 6443, "si": 1}, {"t": "witness", "s": 6503, "e": 6823, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 6863, "e": 6923, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6943, "e": 7023, "si": 1}, {"t": "sufferings", "s": 7103, "e": 7524, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7544, "e": 7604, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ,", "s": 7664, "e": 8144, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 8825, "e": 8905, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 8945, "e": 9125, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 9225, "e": 9245, "si": 1}, {"t": "partaker", "s": 9325, "e": 9906, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 9946, "e": 10026, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10046, "e": 10126, "si": 1}, {"t": "glory", 